            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Bengali for an evening worship with lamps, then the Bengali for to swing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: বিসর্জন",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বিসর্জন — bisôrjôn — \"the immersion of an idol\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পুজোর শেষ দিনে প্রতিমার বিসর্জন হয়। pujor shesh dine prôtimār bisôrjôn hôy. On the last day of the puja comes the immersion of the image."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বিসর্জন (bisôrjôn) is Sanskrit visarjana, 'sending forth, dismissal' (Monier-Williams), which already names the casting of a deity's image into holy water at the close of a festival."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
