          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বিদায় (bidāy) is Sanskrit vidāya; Monier-Williams gives 'dismissal with good wishes' and suspects that this sense is not Sanskrit at all but Arabic wadāʿ, 'farewell'. বিদায় নেওয়া, to take your leave."
            }
